## former client from 2023, 3 miscarriages since her daughter was born, the last one 6 weeks ago, she and her husband have decided to stop

Lead: i did your program back in 2023 when we started trying for our second. 3 miscarriages since then, the last one 6 weeks ago. i don't think i can do this anymore. thank you for everything you did back then.

Sonia: I'm so sorry for your losses ❤️ Thank you for telling me, and for your kind words.

